TEST ONLY: PCI: debugfs hooks and delays for pciehp-reset-lab

Not for upstream.  Builds drivers/pci/pcitest_hooks.c into the kernel and
adds delay knobs to pciehp, pci_device_add() and pci_device_probe(), for the
reproducers of https://github.com/opsound/pciehp-reset-lab that QEMU can't
trigger otherwise.  Every hook and knob is inert until written to:

- /sys/kernel/debug/pcitest/host_reset emulates pci_host_reset_root_port(),
  which takes pci_rescan_remove_lock and resets the Root Port's slot; QEMU's
  q35 has no host-common link-down handling.  link_down (only with
  CONFIG_PCI_HOST_GENERIC=y) runs the real pci-host-common link-down
  recovery for the Root Ports of the device's host bridge.
- err_reset, aer_reset and aer_host_reset emulate AER/DPC recovery resets
  (pci_bus_error_reset(), pcie_do_recovery()); aer_link_delay_ms widens the
  window between the error_detected walk and the reset.
- slot_reset calls the hotplug slot's ->reset_slot() directly.
- link_change queues the Data Link Layer State Changed event that a real
  port reports after a Secondary Bus Reset; QEMU's ports never report it.
- hold_rescan_ms holds pci_rescan_remove_lock; remove_locked removes a
  device with the lock held across the whole removal.
- rpm_allow lets a port without a PM capability runtime suspend.
- pciehp test_pre_scan_ms/test_post_scan_ms, pcitest/add_delay_ms and
  pcitest/probe_delay_ms widen the windows before and after pciehp scans a
  hot-added slot, between pci_device_add() putting a device on bus->devices
  and device_add(), and inside a driver's probe.

Applies to the pciehp-reset-fixes branch of https://github.com/opsound/linux
(f1ceb362d0e9), whose pciehp_pci.c differs from v7.4-rc1 near the
post-scan call site.
Apply with "git apply" or "patch -p1".  The lab's build applies it to the
kernels whose names contain "hooks".
---
 drivers/pci/Makefile                    |   5 +
 drivers/pci/hotplug/Makefile            |   3 +
 drivers/pci/hotplug/pciehp_pci.c        |   4 +
 drivers/pci/hotplug/pciehp_test_knobs.c |  66 ++++
 drivers/pci/pci-driver.c                |   3 +
 drivers/pci/pcitest_hooks.c             | 505 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/pci/probe.c                     |   3 +
 7 files changed, 589 insertions(+)

